  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. accelerate the implementation of the sendai framework for disaster risk reduction by driving visibility of research, scientific innovation, and technology for disaster risk reduction. 2. provide support to humanitarian actors and clusters to implement priority recommendations for drr management 3. expand local governments capacity to develop local disaster risk reduction action plans through technical assistance 4. drive awareness of emergency management strategies using local media</narrative>
  </description>
